Umm, there's a bunch of xorns there, too. But by the time the OP has
gained three levels, the AC and HP situation shouldn't be that
precarious any more.

> > 4. Do wizards normally do the castle or the quest first?  (Medusa
> > won't be a problem - I have a pickaxe, a towel, and a mirror)
> 
> Quest, I'd say.  It's easier than the castle IMO, and the Eye is a
> wonderful, wonderful artifact.

I agree. For the wizard, it's highly desirable to get the Eye as soon
as possible - its power regeneration helps a lot clearing out crammed
places like Ludios and the castle.

> You may want an oilskin sack (or normal sack if necessary) in which to
> keep your BoH, so that it won't become un-blessed.

That should be pretty much a non-issue, as long as Magicbane stays
wielded (and with several potions of holy water in the bag).

